#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:3
#: accc78245e0f48ccaad08cb3e202a0d0
msgid "局域磁响应（Local Magnetic Response）"
msgstr "Local Magnetic Response"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:5
#: 515bcf12450b4fdba74b95f0988a20c1
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:7
#: 6cad991d6b7f43aba5232b6b4659945d
msgid "这张卡做什么"
msgstr "What This Card Does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:9
#: 9ba7e4292c3d45b6b3c206e352fc8b27
msgid ""
"输入一帧带矢量磁矩的结构，围绕指定原子、原子对或 group 生成一条受控响应路径。每个目标对应一个完整 group，group "
"内含零扰动参考帧，适合比较局域磁矩变化前后的能量和磁力响应。"
msgstr ""
"Given one structure with vector magnetic moments, generate a controlled response path"
" around specified atoms, atom pairs, or groups. Every target forms one complete "
"response group containing a zero-perturbation reference frame, suitable for comparing"
" energy and magnetic-force responses before and after a local moment change."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:11
#: 6968e2322eb945c284de06bb7249e44a
msgid "它与“自旋扰动”的区别是：这里的坐标有顺序、正负分支成对且每组自带参考帧；自旋扰动用于随机扩充构型。"
msgstr ""
"Unlike `Spin Perturb`, the response coordinates here are ordered, negative and "
"positive branches are paired, and every group includes its own reference frame. Spin "
"Perturb is intended for random configuration augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:13
#: 681b5c4cf4d1459eb4f4403aa5837864
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:15
#: 0ef19bab20f444e3a82add9c0080e7cc
#, python-brace-format
msgid "设输入磁矩为 $\\mathbf S_i$，笛卡尔旋转轴的单位向量为 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$。旋转使用 Rodrigues 公式："
msgstr ""
"Let the input moment be $\\mathbf S_i$ and the unit Cartesian rotation axis be "
"$\\hat{\\mathbf n}$. Rotation uses Rodrigues' formula:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:17
#: cb6369fc0808467f9f53f0379522a7e7
msgid ""
"\n"
"R_{\\hat{\\mathbf n}}(\\theta)\\mathbf S\n"
"=\\mathbf S\\cos\\theta\n"
"+(\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\times\\mathbf S)\\sin\\theta\n"
"+\\hat{\\mathbf n}(\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\cdot\\mathbf S)(1-\\cos\\theta).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:24
#: 81fd43cbc2b34da7aa41ed65ce249d46
msgid "**单原子倾斜：** 选中磁矩变为 $R_{\\hat{\\mathbf n}}(\\theta)\\mathbf S_i$。"
msgstr ""
"**Single-spin tilt:** the selected moment becomes $R_{\\hat{\\mathbf "
"n}}(\\theta)\\mathbf S_i$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:25
#: 83e10200070f466db1294b978dc35daa
msgid "**原子对倾斜：** 左原子旋转 $+\\theta/2$，右原子旋转 $-\\theta/2$；$\\theta$ 是两侧的总相对转角。"
msgstr ""
"**Atom-pair canting:** the left atom rotates by $+\\theta/2$ and the right atom by "
"$-\\theta/2$; $\\theta$ is their total relative rotation angle."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:26
#: fb123b2a15f346a1bd0fa1cbeb9be1ae
msgid "**分组对倾斜：** 对两个 `group` 中的全部非零磁矩执行相同的 $+\\theta/2$ 与 $-\\theta/2$ 旋转。"
msgstr ""
"**Group-pair canting:** apply the same $+\\theta/2$ and $-\\theta/2$ rotations to all"
" nonzero moments in the two `group` labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:27
#: 68a2fac0c03e4e96a5f81b895a0bd403
msgid "**磁矩模长：** 方向不变，选中磁矩变为 $\\mathbf S_i(s)=s\\mathbf S_i$。元数据中的响应坐标记录为 $s-1$，因此参考帧仍位于 0。"
msgstr ""
"**Moment magnitude:** preserve direction and change the selected moment to $\\mathbf "
"S_i(s)=s\\mathbf S_i$. Metadata stores the response coordinate as $s-1$, so the "
"reference frame remains at zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:29
#: 86aeacf84a9644efa22f96599ffd3173
msgid "旋转模式的界面角度单位为度，输出 `response_coordinate` 使用弧度。"
msgstr ""
"Rotation angles in the interface use degrees, while output `response_coordinate` uses"
" radians."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:31
#: 211a0f49b3d041c4bf69639e4148b649
msgid "输出数量怎么算"
msgstr "How Output Count Is Calculated"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:33
#: b882fcdc85d44de49a78dec1f9ff79a1
msgid "每个目标、原子对或分组对各生成一个完整 group："
msgstr "Each target, atom pair, or group pair generates one complete response group:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:35
#: cae76247020a4c0d9b41a594019338bd
msgid "N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{group}}\\times N_{\\mathrm{coordinate}}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:37
#: 90272e8da4b54126964de0281fba5e6a
msgid "例如五点扫描 `-2,-1,0,1,2`："
msgstr "For a five-point scan `-2,-1,0,1,2`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:39
#: 7961200956aa4637882017e78833f078
msgid "首个合格原子：$1\\times5=5$ 帧；"
msgstr "first eligible atom: $1\\times5=5$ frames;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:40
#: d6630c62ee7a465a9c742b402850f495
msgid "显式选择原子 `1,3`：$2\\times5=10$ 帧；"
msgstr "explicit atoms `1,3`: $2\\times5=10$ frames;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:41
#: ff1d21aba3ae4ba0896e54d8825d1755
msgid "自动找到 4 对近邻：$4\\times5=20$ 帧；"
msgstr "four automatically found neighbor pairs: $4\\times5=20$ frames;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:42
#: 1dcb6341ab3b43c0be2720a350dda10b
msgid "group A/B：$1\\times5=5$ 帧。"
msgstr "groups A/B: $1\\times5=5$ frames."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:44
#: 253a72748ea14e04b56bcd03d542bcdc
msgid "“最大结构数”只在 group 之间截断，不会留下不完整的扫描。如果上限小于一个 group 的坐标数，运行会报错。"
msgstr ""
"`Maximum structures` truncates only between response groups and never leaves an "
"incomplete scan. If the limit is smaller than the coordinate count of one group, the "
"operation reports an error."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:46
#: a490a96fcf9d4f44bda7685d0e9595e0
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:48
#: f9c3dad5bb1940e4987c4347162bd7b1
msgid "确认输入含 `spin:R:3` 或可转换为三分量的初始磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the input contains `spin:R:3` or initial moments convertible to three "
"components."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:49
#: 4f98186d10d842edbf37977b02c5b911
msgid "选择响应类型，再选择目标原子、原子对或 group。"
msgstr "Select a response type, then choose target atoms, atom pairs, or groups."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:50
#: 44b226d2f067486bbdd45cd31e25e543
msgid "旋转响应使用含 0 的对称角度扫描；模长响应使用含 1.0 的比例扫描。"
msgstr ""
"Use a symmetric angle scan containing 0 for rotation responses, and a scale scan "
"containing 1.0 for magnitude responses."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:51
#: 4d6a16eb6e80474e93f20ebe67b2ff5a
msgid "运行后按 `response_group` 检查每组是否同时含 minus、reference 和 plus 分支。"
msgstr ""
"After running, inspect each `response_group` to confirm that it contains minus, "
"reference, and plus branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:53
#: e650127dec5c409a87aa6f3410e6704c
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:55
#: 1f094a6b5d764cf99f9b8fc9658ab3de
msgid "响应类型（response_kind）"
msgstr "Response Type (response_kind)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:57
#: acbd4f9c34824971ae2b9fb5d1b91335
msgid ""
"默认 `Atom pair canting`。可选 `Single-spin tilt`、`Atom pair canting`、`Group pair "
"canting`、`Moment magnitude`。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Atom pair canting`. Available values are `Single-spin tilt`, `Atom pair "
"canting`, `Group pair canting`, and `Moment magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:59
#: e657cda3c4a243eab5f297475f94bdf3
msgid "旋转角扫描（coordinate_scan_deg）"
msgstr "Rotation-Angle Scan (coordinate_scan_deg)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:61
#: 9502e766d5f54d02b70be1ed4fbe22e5
msgid "默认 `-2,-1,0,1,2` 度，仅用于三种旋转响应。至少三个不同坐标并包含 0；输出元数据换算为弧度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `-2,-1,0,1,2` degrees, used only by the three rotation responses. At least "
"three distinct coordinates are required and zero must be included; output metadata "
"converts them to radians."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:63
#: 3b8263c055554739a05f02bf6f786bdc
msgid "目标选择（target_mode）"
msgstr "Target Selection (target_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:65
#: 230b045b5c2f4a22b00583a2f27f0817
msgid "默认 `First eligible atom`。单原子倾斜和磁矩模长可选择首个合格原子、全部合格原子或显式索引。"
msgstr ""
"Default `First eligible atom`. Single-spin tilt and moment-magnitude responses may "
"target the first eligible atom, all eligible atoms, or explicit indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:67
#: 0d8d987c26624632a844ff0921c992db
msgid "原子索引（target_indices）"
msgstr "Atom Indices (target_indices)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:69
#: 0164c6b25c264a9f832442b02d39d6a9
msgid "默认空，仅在 `Explicit indices` 下显示。使用 1-based 索引，例如 `1,3-5`。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default and displayed only under `Explicit indices`. Use 1-based indices, "
"for example `1,3-5`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:71
#: cf23426e885941e0be3cf78f5d38af0c
msgid "原子对来源（pair_source）"
msgstr "Atom-Pair Source (pair_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:73
#: 6cfebf9882f94f889c434e435d23874b
msgid "默认 `Manual indices`。可手动配对，也可按近邻壳层自动选取无重复原子对。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Manual indices`. Pairs may be specified manually or selected automatically "
"as unique atom pairs from a neighbor shell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:75
#: 162229af2b664b2591c9852baca7fbfa
msgid "左侧原子索引（pair_left_indices）"
msgstr "Left Atom Indices (pair_left_indices)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:77
#: d2b9b7edb467486b922b2099e5e0d029
msgid "默认 `1`。手动配对时使用 1-based 索引；数量必须与右侧一致。"
msgstr "Default `1`. Manual pairing uses 1-based indices; the count must match the right side."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:79
#: f1409a27835f48bf99aafb7ecf90953d
msgid "右侧原子索引（pair_right_indices）"
msgstr "Right Atom Indices (pair_right_indices)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:81
#: b8b601b52c8f4ffcac1693f7af23cc99
msgid "默认 `2`。按顺序与左侧索引一一配对。"
msgstr "Default `2`. Paired one-to-one with the left indices in order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:83
#: a68260b63f3e4938a97efba9d11b2a5f
msgid "近邻壳层（pair_shell）"
msgstr "Neighbor Shell (pair_shell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:85
#: 6c09b06e4816461eb5f96ab373ab5406
msgid "默认 `1`，仅用于自动配对。`1` 表示最近邻壳层，`2` 表示第二近邻壳层。"
msgstr ""
"Default `1`, used only for automatic pairing. `1` denotes the nearest-neighbor shell "
"and `2` the second-neighbor shell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:87
#: 9b6bfd2481fc4173af6f4ff1626be4ed
msgid "分壳容差（pair_shell_tolerance）"
msgstr "Shell Tolerance (pair_shell_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:89
#: 9da58f99ca5e4c45bc3c09dc2d0969c0
msgid "默认 `0.05` Å。距离差不超过此值的原子对归入同一近邻壳层。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0.05` Å. Atom pairs whose distances differ by no more than this value are "
"assigned to the same neighbor shell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:91
#: 5f278bfb71294eca8ce642f80fc8499a
msgid "元素对筛选（pair_element_filter）"
msgstr "Element-Pair Filter (pair_element_filter)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:93
#: 07700d2998354cb196e7588e41287611
msgid "默认空，表示不筛选。可写 `Fe-Co` 或 `Fe-Fe,Fe-Co`。"
msgstr "Empty by default, meaning no filter. Enter `Fe-Co` or `Fe-Fe,Fe-Co`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:95
#: 59f8a523931f411ea9f8a4e359c7c821
msgid "标签对筛选（pair_group_filter）"
msgstr "Group-Pair Filter (pair_group_filter)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:97
#: f91c6cc2ba844919893f4e384c439cee
msgid "默认空，表示不筛选。可写 `A-B`；输入必须含 `atoms.arrays['group']`。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default, meaning no filter. Enter `A-B`; the input must contain "
"`atoms.arrays['group']`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:99
#: 45af94583a0b4f7bb8158e47c74021e5
msgid "键方向筛选（bond_filter_mode）"
msgstr "Bond-Direction Filter (bond_filter_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:101
#: 7406631e06de4902a68a8b92f59f8ffa
msgid "默认 `Any`。可选 `Any`、`Near axis`、`Near plane`，分别表示不限方向、靠近参考轴、靠近以参考向量为法向的平面。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Any`. Available values are `Any`, `Near axis`, and `Near plane`, meaning "
"unrestricted direction, close to a reference axis, or close to a plane whose normal "
"is the reference vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:103
#: 09a1701848b3492683a8db60d2577d42
msgid "键方向参考（bond_filter_axis）"
msgstr "Bond-Direction Reference (bond_filter_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:105
#: 6b5fd5d8c8444f98a86d19abe2108856
msgid "默认 `[0,0,1]`，为笛卡尔向量；在 `Near axis` 中表示轴，在 `Near plane` 中表示平面法向。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,0,1]`, a Cartesian vector. It denotes the axis in `Near axis` and the "
"plane normal in `Near plane`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:107
#: cb7aca0572464d0198e3cd1ebdc9e0f0
msgid "键方向容差（bond_filter_tolerance）"
msgstr "Bond-Direction Tolerance (bond_filter_tolerance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:109
#: 454c09603ef5423889683c157cf31365
msgid "默认 `20` 度。只在启用方向筛选时生效。"
msgstr "Default `20` degrees. Used only when a direction filter is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:111
#: 5433d540a68a4eb49769f10732f59eb8
msgid "左分组（group_a）"
msgstr "Left Group (group_a)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:113
#: 5dbc2af32ed94ef1b928229f72fbce0d
msgid "默认 `A`。group A 的非零磁矩旋转 $+\\theta/2$。"
msgstr "Default `A`. Nonzero moments in group A rotate by $+\\theta/2$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:115
#: b7abf8ac894748c4963a3d976ff8eaac
msgid "右分组（group_b）"
msgstr "Right Group (group_b)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:117
#: 65afc1a346ad4310ae8ec699ee087ab5
msgid "默认 `B`。group B 的非零磁矩旋转 $-\\theta/2$。"
msgstr "Default `B`. Nonzero moments in group B rotate by $-\\theta/2$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:119
#: bd1ed4c0dd36449597a2e6e8d2b49930
msgid "旋转轴（rotation_axis）"
msgstr "Rotation Axis (rotation_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:121
#: 77f043b5ac984d2f8fb22100fd224fd0
msgid "默认 `[0,1,0]`，为笛卡尔向量，仅用于旋转响应。若磁矩平行于旋转轴，该磁矩不会改变。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,1,0]`, a Cartesian vector used only for rotation responses. A moment "
"parallel to the rotation axis does not change."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:123
#: e703da721c274323ad3974442dda2dbd
msgid "合格元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "Eligible Elements (apply_elements)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:125
#: f5ed4585463b4d21823c72fe0c96fca2
msgid "默认空，表示所有元素。只允许所列元素中模长非零的磁矩成为单原子目标或自动原子对候选，例如 `Fe,Co`。"
msgstr ""
"Empty by default, meaning all elements. Only nonzero moments on listed elements may "
"become single-atom targets or automatic pair candidates, for example `Fe,Co`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:127
#: fe55b2c7d3754e2c8e6f59ddbe5079b5
msgid "模长比例扫描（moment_scale_scan）"
msgstr "Moment-Scale Scan (moment_scale_scan)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:129
#: 7e6ad00d84a14bac8ac7fb7c6c48b902
msgid "默认 `0.8,0.9,1.0,1.1,1.2`，仅用于磁矩模长响应。比例必须非负、互不重复并包含 1.0。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0.8,0.9,1.0,1.1,1.2`, used only for the moment-magnitude response. Scales "
"must be nonnegative, distinct, and include 1.0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:131
#: bd4879eddd9e4d738fc917a805adddda
msgid "最大结构数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Structures (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:133
#: 06517510e9cf4836aa443f997c0d272f
msgid "默认 `100`。只保留能完整放入预算的 group。"
msgstr ""
"Default `100`. Only response groups that fit completely within the budget are "
"retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:135
#: b051f09e60cc426da05a22a094ab7b03
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:137
#: 05903f802bba4cf3a540117acd2ea149
msgid "**没有可用目标：** 检查输入磁矩是否为非零三分量向量，以及原子索引和合格元素是否匹配。"
msgstr ""
"**No usable targets:** check that input moments are nonzero three-component vectors "
"and that atom indices and eligible elements match."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:138
#: c8698ef6e1ed45ab9e755cb75835b0b3
msgid "**自动配对为空：** 先关闭可选筛选并确认近邻壳层，再逐项加入元素对、标签对或键方向限制。"
msgstr ""
"**Automatic pairing is empty:** disable optional filters and confirm the neighbor "
"shell first, then add element-pair, group-pair, or bond-direction constraints one at "
"a time."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:139
#: 6a262233ad244b78ad87166c79637025
msgid "**分组对为空：** 先用“原子层分组”卡写入 `group`，并确认两个标签中都存在非零磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"**Group pair is empty:** use Layer Groups first to write `group`, and confirm that "
"both labels contain nonzero moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:141
#: ad87e62ae24444cbbd611086f65cb846
msgid "输出字段"
msgstr "Output Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-magnetic-response-card.md:143
#: 31b9519cf16540f8adfee02eed51783a
msgid ""
"输出保留结构的原子、坐标、晶胞和 PBC，磁矩统一写入 `spin:R:3`。每帧带有 "
"`response_group`、`response_coordinate`、`response_branch`、`response_task_id` "
"和来源结构标识；相同输入与参数会得到确定性的响应内容和任务标识。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs preserve atoms, coordinates, cell, and PBC, while moments are standardized in"
" `spin:R:3`. Every frame contains `response_group`, `response_coordinate`, "
"`response_branch`, `response_task_id`, and source-structure identification. Identical"
" inputs and parameters produce deterministic response content and task identifiers."
